      "comment": "Beisht: Osial",
      "content": "Osial was the Overlord of the Vortex, a sea-god sealed or defeated at the end of the Archon War, who attacked Liyue Harbor when freed. Beisht is described as his wife and last follower.\n\nNingguang notes that the Jade Chamber is what defeated him in the earlier age, which is why its return provoked Beisht.",
